ssion Enquiry\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n','Contact Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 20:00:43','2026-09-26 14:30:43','',17,'http://localhost:8092/?p=79',0,'revision','',0),
(80,0,'2026-09-26 20:00:43','2026-09-26 14:30:43','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"has-large-font-size\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">A four-year professional degree that builds a strong foundation in nursing science, anatomy and direct patient care, with extensive hospital practice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"light\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-light-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-clipboard\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-clipboard\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key facts</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Level</td><td>Undergraduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>4 years (including internship)</td></tr><tr><td>Seats</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Affiliation</td><td>Pt. B.D. Sharma UHS, Rohtak</td></tr><tr><td>Approval</td><td>INC &amp; HNRC</td></tr><tr><td>Admission</td><td>UHSR entrance test &amp; counselling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-check\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-check\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eligibility</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"sr-icon-list\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list sr-icon-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>10+2 from a recognised board with Physics, Chemistry, Biology and English</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Minimum 50% aggregate in PCB (relaxation for SC/ST/OBC as per government norms)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Minimum age 17 years on or before 31 December of the admission year</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Admission through the entrance test and counselling conducted by Pt. B.D. Sharma UHS, Rohtak</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What you will study</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Anatomy, physiology, biochemistry, microbiology and pharmacology</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nursing foundations and adult health (medical-surgical) nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Child health, mental health and community health nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Midwifery and obstetrical nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nursing research, management and professional ethics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Supervised clinical practice in our 100-bed hospital and the community</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Career opportunities</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Staff nurse in government and private hospitals</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Community health nurse / public health programmes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Military Nursing Service, railways and ESIC hospitals</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nursing tutor (with higher qualifications)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Opportunities abroad, including the Middle East and the UK, after licensing exams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Higher studies: M.Sc Nursing, MBA in Hospital Management, MPH</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"sr-dark sr-cta-band\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"680px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull sr-dark sr-cta-band\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Ready to apply?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">See the admission process, documents required and fees, or send us an enquiry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/admissions/\">Admission process</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Enquire now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n','B.Sc Nursing','','inherit','closed','closed','','20-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 20:00:43','2026-09-26 14:30:43','',20,'http://localhost:8092/?p=80',0,'revision','',0),
(81,0,'2026-09-26 20:00:43','2026-09-26 14:30:43','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"has-large-font-size\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">A two-year degree for registered GNM nurses who want to upgrade to a B.Sc qualification and take on greater clinical and leadership roles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"light\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-light-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-clipboard\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-clipboard\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key facts</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Level</td><td>Undergraduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>2 years</td></tr><tr><td>Seats</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>Affiliation</td><td>Pt. B.D. Sharma UHS, Rohtak</td></tr><tr><td>Approval</td><td>INC &amp; HNRC</td></tr><tr><td>Admission</td><td>UHSR counselling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-check\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sr-feature sr-icon sr-icon--soft ico-check\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eligibility</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"sr-icon-list\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list sr-icon-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Passed 10+2 (Science stream preferred)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Passed the GNM (General Nursing &amp; Midwifery) course</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Registered nurse and midwife with a State Nursing Registration Council</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What you will study</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advanced nursing practice and nursing education</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Community health nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Maternal, child and mental health nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Introduction to nursing research and statistics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nursing administration and ward management</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Career opportunities</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Senior staff nurse and ward in-charge roles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Public health and community nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nursing tutor / clinical instructor</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Higher studies: M.Sc Nursing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"sr-dark sr-cta-band\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"